DF 9 90 DFMOD
.MODEL DFMOD D N = 2 IS = 1E-009 RS = 0.0184853
+ EG = 1.11 XTI = 3
+ CJO = 1.606E-009 VJ = 1.68538 M = 0.42 FC = 0.5
+ TT = 1E-008 T_MEASURED = 25
