RL 9 90 RLMOD 5.4E+007 
.MODEL RLMOD RES TC1 = 0 TC2 = 0 T_MEASURED = 25
* Breakdown
RBD 90 4 1.392
EBD 4 3 10 20 1
DBD 3 9 DBDMOD 
.MODEL DBDMOD D IS = 1E-015 N = 0.5 T_MEASURED = 25 T_ABS = 25
IBVC 0 10 0.001
RBVC 10 0 RBVCMOD 63150 
.MODEL RBVCMOD RES TC1 = 0 T_MEASURED = 25
RBDX 20 23 1.392
DBVC 23 0 DBDMOD 
IBVD 0 20 0.001
L1 90 2 1E-015
.ENDS